lor: transparent;">Some plans include senior citizen coverage, while others may require separate policies for elderly parents.</span></p><h3><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">4. What is cashless hospitalization?</span></h3><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">Cashless hospitalization allows policyholders to receive treatment without paying the hospital bill upfront at network hospitals.</span></p><h3><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">5. How much health insurance cover should a family have?</span></h3><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">Most families prefer coverage between ₹10–25 lakhs depending on healthcare needs and family size.</span></p><h2><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">Protect Your Family with the Right Health Insurance Plan</span></h2><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">A reliable family health insurance plan protects both your health and financial future during unexpected medical situations. Choosing the </span><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">best health insurance in Madurai</strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;"> helps families access quality healthcare, cashless hospitalization and long-term financial security.</span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">Investing in the right health insurance plan today can help your family stay prepared for tomorrow’s healthcare challenges.</span></p><p><br></p>

